现在关于 `ProtoDualSubscriber`的实现细节：

```cpptemplate<typename RosidlMsgT, typename ProtoT>
class ProtoDualSubscriber{
public:
 using RosidlSharedPtr = typename RosidlMsgT::SharedPtr;
 using Callback = std::function<void(const RosidlSharedPtr)>;

 template<typename NodeT>
 ProtoDualSubscriber(NodeT * node, const std::string & rosidl_name,
 std::size_t qos_depth, bool proto_side, Callback callback)
 : rosidl_topic_(rosidl_name), proto_topic_(ProtoTopicName(rosidl_name)), proto_side_(proto_side)
 {
 if (proto_side_) {
 proto_sub_ = node->template create_subscription<ProtoT>(
 proto_topic_, rclcpp::QoS(qos_depth),
 [callback](const ProtoT & proto_msg) {
 auto out = std::make_shared<RosidlMsgT>();
 ProjectProtoToRosidl(proto_msg, out.get());
 callback(out);
 });
 } else {
 rosidl_sub_ = node->template create_subscription<RosidlMsgT>(
 rosidl_topic_, rclcpp::QoS(qos_depth), callback);
 }
 }
 ...
};
```

注意：`node->template create_subscription` ——因为 NodeT是依赖类型，需要 `template`关键字。

`rosidl::QoS(qos_depth)` vs `qos_depth`。现有代码用 `10`直接传。`create_subscription`接受 `const rclcpp::QoS&`也有 size_t重载？实际上签名是 `create_subscription(const std::string&, const rclcpp::QoS&, callback, options)`。传 `10`会隐式转换成 `rclcpp::QoS(10)`（QoS有 `explicit QoS(const HistoryPolicy&, size_t)`？）。实际上 rclcpp有 `create_subscription(topic, size_t qos_history_depth, callback)`的重载。所以传 int也可以。但为一致性我传 `rclcpp::QoS(qos_depth)`。

